msgstr "開始選單最小寬度"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5382
msgid "Modal tab label font scale"
msgstr "對話框頁籤標籤字型縮放"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5459
msgid "Cover labels"
msgstr "封面標籤"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5460
msgid "Cover badges"
msgstr "封面徽章"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5461
msgid "Stack & folder labels"
msgstr "書堆與資料夾標籤"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5462
msgid "Shelf menu"
msgstr "書架選單"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5473
msgid "List text"
msgstr "清單文字"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5478
msgid "Top panel"
msgstr "頂部面板"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5480 lib/bookshelf_widget.lua:13377
msgid "Micro-modules"
msgstr "微型模組"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5486
msgid "Modal tabs"
msgstr "對話框頁籤"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5503
msgid "Choose image library folder"
msgstr "選擇圖片庫資料夾"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5529
msgid "\"Latest\" folder walk depth"
msgstr "「最新」資料夾搜尋深度"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5530
msgid "How deep to scan your library folder for newly-added books. Higher values take longer on a cold start."
msgstr "設定掃描藏書庫資料夾以尋找新新增書籍的深度。數值越高，冷啟動耗時越長。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5548
msgid "MB"
msgstr "MB"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5549
msgid "Cover cache budget"
msgstr "封面快取記憶體預算"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5550
msgid "Memory budget for ready-scaled book covers (MB). Higher = smoother paging and preloading, more RAM. Default %1 MB on this device."
msgstr "用於存放已縮放好的書籍封面的記憶體上限 (MB)。數值越高，換頁與預先載入越順暢，占用的記憶體也越多。本裝置預設為 %1 MB。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5673
msgid ""
"Another copy of Bookshelf is installed and is also being loaded:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Remove it and restart, or updates may appear to do nothing."
msgstr ""
"偵測到另一份 Bookshelf 已安裝，並且同樣被載入：\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"請將其移除並重新啟動，否則更新可能看起來毫無作用。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5708
msgid "Link copied to clipboard"
msgstr "連結已複製至剪貼簿"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5798 main.lua:786
msgid "Update available"
msgstr "有可用更新"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5801 lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5858
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "檢查更新"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5803
msgid "Checks GitHub for a newer Bookshelf release and offers to install it, with the release notes shown first. The version in brackets is what's installed."
msgstr "檢查 GitHub 上是否有較新的 Bookshelf 版本，並提供安裝選項，安裝前會先顯示發布說明。括號中的版本號為目前已安裝的版本。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5810
msgid "View changelog"
msgstr "檢視更新日誌"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5811
msgid "Browse this and past releases' notes, newest first. Notes are cached, so anything fetched once stays readable offline; Refresh pulls the latest."
msgstr "瀏覽本次及過往版本的發布說明，由新到舊排列。說明會被快取，因此只要曾經取得過即可離線閱讀；點擊「重新整理」可取得最新內容。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5821
msgid "Notify on wake when update available"
msgstr "喚醒時若有更新則發出通知"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5832 lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5836
msgid "Developer updates"
msgstr "開發者更新"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5842 lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5843
#: main.lua:2181
msgid "Development branch"
msgstr "開發分支 (Development branch)"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5859
msgid "Install branch"
msgstr "安裝分支"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5865
msgid "Reset to latest stable release"
msgstr "重置為最新穩定版本"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5876 lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5879
msgid "Installed: v"
msgstr "已安裝：v"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5919
msgid "Flexible shelf widths"
msgstr "自適應書架寬度"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5920
msgid "Off: every shelf gets the same width. On: each shelf is sized to its label, so single-icon shelves stay narrow and longer text labels get more room. Falls back to equal widths when natural sizes don't fit."
msgstr "關閉：所有書架維持相同寬度。開啟：依據標籤文字長度自動調整寬度，使單圖示書架保持窄幅，較長文字獲得更多空間。若自然尺寸超出範圍則自動還原為等寬。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5935
msgid "Uppercase labels"
msgstr "標籤文字大寫"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:5936
msgid "On: shelf names and the drill breadcrumb are shown in capitals, the default look. Off: each label reads exactly as you typed it, so \"Sci-Fi\" stays \"Sci-Fi\"."
msgstr "開啟：書架名稱與路徑列均以大寫顯示，此為預設外觀。關閉：每個名稱將完全依您輸入的原始文字顯示，例如「Sci-Fi」會維持「Sci-Fi」不變。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6010
msgid "Tap a shelf to edit it. Long-press to show or hide it."
msgstr "點擊書架即可編輯，長按可顯示或隱藏。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6015
msgid "+ Add new shelf"
msgstr "+ 新增書架"

